~ start
Kioskmann: [[Yo|Hi|Hey]].

- Ayo, get me a toasted bacon dog with crispy onions. [#response_type=hard_mode]
- Uh.. one hotdog, please. [#response_type=easy_mode]
=> END

~ kioskmann_win_hard
Kioskman: Damn. [wait=1]
Kioskman: You seem like someone who knows what they want!
=> END

~ kioskmann_win_easy
Kioskman: Here you go.
=> END

~ kioskmann_lose
Kioskman: ... Hm, did you say something?
Kioskman: ...
=> END

~ kioskmann_dab_up
Kioskmann: Bro. What a customer!
Kioskman: I can't believe it.
Kioskman: Dab me up bro!
=> END
